sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Utente
    participant Gateway as Server Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth System (JWT)
    box lightgray Blockchain System
        participant API as API Blockchain (AddKV)
        participant Core as Blockchain Core (Consensus)
        participant Ledger as State DB (KV Store)
    end

    Utente->>Gateway: API Request (POST api/v1/bids)
    
    activate Gateway
    Gateway->>Auth: Valida Token & Identità
    Auth-->>Gateway: Autorizzato
    
    Note over Gateway: Traduzione:<br/>Bid(User, Price, Auction) ➔ KV(Key, Val)
    
    Gateway->>API: Richiama AddKV(Key, Value)
    
    activate API
    API->>Core: Proposta Transazione
    Note over Core: Validazione & Consenso<br/>tra i nodi
    
    Core->>Ledger: Scrittura Coppia KV
    Note right of Ledger: Class: Bids<br/>Key: bid_id<br/>Value: {user, auction, price, timestamp}
    
    Ledger-->>API: Conferma Memorizzazione
    deactivate API
    
    API-->>Gateway: Transaction Hash / Success
    Gateway-->>Utente: Risposta Successo (Bid creata)
    deactivate Gateway